   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Action in progress",
     "texto": [
      "**Mergeam** means «I was going» or «I was on my way»; **ploua**, «it was raining». They are imperfect forms."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Contrast",
     "texto": [
      "**În timp ce** means «while». The finished action can appear afterwards: **a început să plouă** («it started to rain»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
